WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:41.390
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:47.830
<i>Taichi Yagami and the Chosen Ones
with their partner Digimon</i>

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:52.290
<i>continue their adventure to stop
the revival of the legendary Millenniumon</i>

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:56.530
<i>while gathering the rest of their friends.</i>

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:00.870
<i>The identity of the mysterious enemy,
Darkknightmon,</i>

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:04.930
<i>turned out to be
the other Holy Digimon, Tailmon.</i>

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:12.960
<i>Hikari and Tailmon were saved and
they finally joined Taichi. However...</i>

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:27.000
Wow, Tailmon's talking
in Komondomon's language.

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.500
Huh? What?

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.010
They said we're gonna dive!

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:43.410
What? All of a sudden?!

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:45.510
I'm already full...

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:09.580
Hang onto something!

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:27.680
HIKARI AND TAILMON

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:34.420
I wanted to get on this current...

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.670
to head toward FAGA.

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:38.440
FAGA...

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:41.090
What kind of place is it?

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:42.470
It's...

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:47.560
A long ago,
deep within this Eternal Continent...

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.850
At the end of the ancient war...

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:56.860
<i>The place where
Millenniumon's largest shard had fallen.</i>

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:03.030
<i>That is the Sealed Grounds, FAGA.</i>

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:06.370
<i>The once-destroyed will of Millenniumon</i>

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:09.670
<i>sparked the greed of wicked minds
who desired power.</i>

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:12.500
<i>And it made them produce
all sorts of evolutions.</i>

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:17.630
Millenniumon...

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:20.260
What in the world for?

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:22.800
So that Millenniumon

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:27.760
can create a new body
to be born into this world once again.

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:33.980
Yes... I was about
to become a part of that.

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:35.040
But...

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:38.610
you didn't end up that way.

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:42.170
Thanks to Hikari's hard work!

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:49.250
Ahem! Millenniumon is still plotting
to return.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:53.680
Before it's too late, we must reach FAGA.

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:58.790
Defeating Millenniumon is my duty
as the Holy Digimon!

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:02.460
Yeah.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:06.470
That's brave, Tailmon.

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:08.010
Yeah.

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:15.520
<i>Hikari, I'll never put you
in danger again.</i>

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:28.590
Oh no! The sea current...

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:48.200
Huh?

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:55.200
What in the world...

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:57.100
is this place?

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:01.150
We mean you no harm!

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:02.400
MANBOMON

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:07.340
Wait! Please listen to us!

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.220
You leave me no choice!

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:26.030
SEAHOMON

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:35.950
Those are... Mantaraymon.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.950
MANTARAYMON

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:39.210
DAIPENMON

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:47.530
Let me!

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.610
Tailmon!

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:53.950
So fast...

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:55.350
Us too!

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:02.980
Neko...

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:05.960
Punch!

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:13.300
Tailmon...

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.540
That's a Holy Ring!

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.270
Who are you?

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:34.300
No, Hikari!
You shouldn't be out in the battlegrounds.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:38.560
But I wanted to be with you.

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:40.660
Hikari...

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:49.010
Our apologies.

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:55.570
We mistook you as assailants
and attacked you.

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:00.100
Not at all.

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:04.650
Please forgive us as well
for our sudden, rude intrusion.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:05.580
I am...

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:07.480
I sense it.

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:10.940
You are the Holy Digimon.

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:13.340
You know us?

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:18.600
I am the one
who governs this underwater city.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:23.170
That necklace
looks like the one on Tailmon's tail.

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:25.350
I feel a great power!

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:27.320
The Holy Ring.

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:32.360
Thanks to this,
I can fight even with a small body.

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:38.700
And my Holy Ring is used as power
to sustain this city's environment.

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:42.350
Patamon, you don't have one?

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:43.600
Umm.

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:48.960
We are currently on a journey to FAGA.

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:53.510
As I expected, Millenniumon's return...

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:58.490
The situation must be dire.

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:03.370
But, at least rest at my castle tonight.

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:11.210
So high!

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:14.340
Hikari, be careful!

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:18.160
During the period of the ancient war,

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:21.850
there were those who sought peace
in the deep seas.

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:23.810
We are their descendants.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:26.860
So you were all Digimon
on land originally?

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:30.190
You must've evolved
and adapted to the ocean.

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:35.920
I have been waiting for you.

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:39.680
How cute.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:42.180
I am Marinangemon.

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:42.180
MARINANGEMON

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:50.750
Yum!

00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:52.070
Yeah!

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:53.820
Superb!

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:02.930
Komondomon, you must be tired.

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:05.680
And it must've hurt when you fell.

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:12.340
So this is where you were, Hikari.

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:17.370
Oh, Tailmon. Komondomon is--

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:19.090
Leave it to me.

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:30.000
Now, Komondomon should be
all better tomorrow.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.860
Thank you, Marinangemon.

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:34.960
Aren't you glad?

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:39.260
A heart with a gentle glow...

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:41.950
The one I must protect...

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:46.750
<i>Taichi-san, I have something to report.</i>

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:48.690
What's wrong, Koshiro?

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:52.770
<i>It's an update
on the International Space Station.</i>

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:57.170
<i>The remaining crew
has escaped in the Soyuz.</i>

00:10:57.690 --> 00:10:59.200
What's a Soyuz?

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:01.530
It's the Russian spacecraft.

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:03.180
Spacecraft?

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:05.950
<i>This is the footage from after that.</i>

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:09.960
<i>Looks like restoring
the orbit wasn't possible.</i>

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:13.190
<i>There are several other satellites
in the collision path too.</i>

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:16.820
Isn't there a way to stop them somehow?

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:21.300
<i>Not at the moment...
If I find anything, I'll report again.</i>

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:23.300
Please, Koshiro.

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:27.770
So there are disasters
reaching the human world as well.

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:29.480
Yeah...

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:32.230
But we'll do something about it!

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:34.980
That's why we're on a journey like this.

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:36.090
Yeah!

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:39.530
Everyone has the heart of a warrior.

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:43.780
I, too... cannot lose.

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:50.980
By the way, who were the Digimon
attacking the city earlier?

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:55.480
We, who've migrated from the surface,
are basically outsiders.

00:11:56.040 --> 00:12:00.670
There is no way to avoid collision
with the original sea dwellers here.

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:03.890
So it's a turf war.

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:05.740
It's just that...

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:13.750
Recently, I feel some kind of a different,
deadly intent from those assailants.

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:15.130
Isn't that...

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:18.300
The black lightning is reaching this far.

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:22.410
Tomorrow,
I shall move this underwater city,

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:25.300
and return you to your sea current.

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:26.410
What?

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:28.580
You're gonna move this whole city?

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:32.000
This is about all we can do at the moment.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:34.560
Thank you, Marinangemon!

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:57.880
Aren't you gonna sleep?

00:12:58.770 --> 00:13:01.530
Once you fall asleep, Hikari.

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:06.140
Hikari...

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:09.700
This is relaxing.

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:11.460
Relaxing?

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:15.290
I don't have time to relax
until I defeat Millenniumon!

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:19.380
I'm relaxed when I'm with you, Tailmon.

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:25.800
Hikari...

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:33.520
Move forth!

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:47.530
Now we can return to the sea current!

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:57.900
What is it?

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:04.670
That is... Anomalocarimon!

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.470
ANOMALOCARIMON

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:21.480
Agumon!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:27.420
Agumon Evolution!

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:29.450
Piyomon!

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:30.370
Yeah!

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:33.740
Piyomon Evolution!

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:37.130
Patamon!

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:38.040
Okay!

00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:41.920
Patamon Evolution!

00:14:46.670 --> 00:14:48.360
Greymon!

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:50.340
Birdramon!

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:52.510
Pegasmon!

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:55.290
Hikari!

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.770
Tailmon, I...

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:01.540
Stay here, Hikari.

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:04.190
Fighting...

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:06.130
is my job.

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:12.550
Neko Punch!

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:01.480
Neko Punch!

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:12.700
Tailmon!

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:16.330
Tailmon!

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:32.950
Greymon!

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:39.990
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.880
Metalgreymon!

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:56.990
Giga Destroyer!

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:00.430
Taichi!

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:04.330
Please, let me too!

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:05.770
Hikari...

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.490
I must do this!

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:33.300
Tailmon!

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:36.610
Hikari?!

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:38.140
Why?!

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:40.620
Go back, Hikari! Leave this to me!

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:42.770
No! Tailmon!

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:45.310
Don't take it all upon yourself!

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:53.170
Hikari!

00:17:58.570 --> 00:17:59.820
Tailmon...

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:03.580
You've always been calling.

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:05.790
Calling for me.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.750
<i>From a long, long time ago.</i>

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:24.620
Since I was very little.

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:27.370
Yes...

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:32.750
I've been calling
from a shrouded darkness.

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:36.900
No, long before that...

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:40.870
Long before that, I've been calling.

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:44.260
I've been waiting for Hikari.

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:47.480
I always knew.

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:54.170
I knew that we were connected
from a long, long time ago.

00:18:56.170 --> 00:19:01.240
Our encounter
was beyond duty, it was fate.

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:07.000
That's why I came to the Digital World.

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:10.500
To save you.

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:13.980
That's why, let me too.

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:16.940
Hikari...

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:21.510
Tailmon...

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:37.420
A Digivice!

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:45.560
Hikari!

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:46.540
Yeah.

00:19:50.980 --> 00:19:53.070
I am the Holy Digimon!

00:19:53.070 --> 00:19:56.550
The one to lead the warriors
and repel darkness together!

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:05.950
Hikari.

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:06.870
Yeah!

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:15.060
Neko Punch!

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:30.410
-Now!
-Giga Storm!

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:32.850
Meteor Wing!

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:35.080
Silver Blaze!

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:00.420
Tailmon...

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:03.590
Yes, Hikari!

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:07.810
From now on, you and I together...

00:21:07.810 --> 00:21:10.060
Let's fight together.

00:22:31.260 --> 00:22:33.060
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:35.560
<i>Tailmon.</i>

00:22:35.560 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>This is Hikari-san's partner Digimon.</i>

00:22:35.640 --> 00:22:38.110
LEVEL: CHAMPION

00:22:38.110 --> 00:22:40.690
TYPE: HOLY BEAST

00:22:38.110 --> 00:22:42.520
<i>The Holy Ring on the tail is proof
of a Holy Digimon!</i>

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:43.340
SPECIAL MOVE: NEKO PUNCH / CAT'S EYE

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:45.010
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:50.740
<i>According to my research, about 87%
of people find cat punches gentle.</i>

00:22:50.740 --> 00:22:55.100
<i>But Tailmon's Neko Punch is a technique.
It's more cool than gentle!</i>

00:22:57.660 --> 00:22:59.920
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:07.840
<i>When Hikari lights Tailmon's heart
with a ray of hope, new wings flutter.</i>

00:23:07.840 --> 00:23:11.720
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Glowing Angewomon"</i>

00:23:11.720 --> 00:23:14.430
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
